,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T09:04:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T09:04:54Z","body":"Relevant part from the log:\r\n```\r\ndrivers/sdl/joypad_sdl.cpp:67:initialize(): Application didn't initialize properly, did you include SDL_main.h in the file containing your main() function? Condition \"!SDL_Init(0x00000200u | 0x00002000u)\" is true. Returning: FAILED\r\ndrivers/apple_embedded/os_apple_embedded.mm:176:initialize_joypads(): Couldn't initialize SDL joypad input driver. Couldn't initialize SDL joypad input driver.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919554770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919585094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114316#issuecomment-3919585094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114316","id":3919585094,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7poB9G","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T09:12:27Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T09:12:27Z","body":"```\r\n#elif defined(SDL_PLATFORM_IOS)\r\n        /* On iOS SDL provides a main function that creates an application delegate\r\n           and starts the iOS application run loop.\r\n\r\n           To use it, just #include SDL_main.h in the source file that contains your\r\n           main() function.\r\n\r\n           See src/video/uikit/SDL_uikitappdelegate.m for more details.\r\n         */\r\n        #define SDL_MAIN_NEEDED\r\n```\r\nSome noted:\r\n- There's no C++ `main`  in iOS, it's using Swift Application.\r\n- We have own app delegate and main loop and can't use one provided by SDL, so SDL likely should be changed to use our loop.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919585094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919627607","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114316#issuecomment-3919627607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114316","id":3919627607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7poMVX","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T09:21:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T09:21:21Z","body":"Simply commenting `#define SDL_MAIN_NEEDED` line seems to be sufficient to make it work (at least it inits, controller is detected and input works), and nothing in the SDL delegate files seems to be relevant for the input. I'll check is light and vibration works a bit later.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919627607/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919664211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114316#issuecomment-3919664211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114316","id":3919664211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7poVRT","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T09:29:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T09:31:07Z","body":"With the following patch (and rebase to master):\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/thirdparty/sdl/include/SDL3/SDL_main.h b/thirdparty/sdl/include/SDL3/SDL_main.h\r\nindex 905d78e964..46e20445aa 100644\r\n--- a/thirdparty/sdl/include/SDL3/SDL_main.h\r\n+++ b/thirdparty/sdl/include/SDL3/SDL_main.h\r\n@@ -174,7 +174,7 @@\r\n\r\n            See src/video/uikit/SDL_uikitappdelegate.m for more details.\r\n          */\r\n-        #define SDL_MAIN_NEEDED\r\n+       // #define SDL_MAIN_NEEDED\r\n\r\n     #elif defined(SDL_PLATFORM_ANDROID)\r\n         /* On Android SDL provides a Java class in SDLActivity.java that is the\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Connecting / disconnecting controllers work.\r\n- Input work.\r\n- Vibrations work.\r\n- Light detection and color work.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919664211/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919817597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114316#issuecomment-3919817597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114316","id":3919817597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7po6t9","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https:/